{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國女歌手G.NA於2010年出道，雖非女團但她以精湛歌舞跟傻大姐的魅力擄獲許多粉絲，擁有《Black &amp; White》、《Top Girl》等代表作。</p><p>最近她在個人社群上宣布將重錄自己的夯曲，雖然G.NA力圖重返演藝圈，但2016年的性交易事件的陰霾猶存，至今在韓媒版面上仍難撕「賣淫女星」的標籤。</p><figure><img alt=\"G.NA最近宣布將重新錄製過去大熱歌曲。（Instagram@missginachoi87）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260625/1146768352107040768723984.png/EEVDJIjvT0T2yTzXCMVILtcCmytV_FboftWtVX7VrVU\"/><figcaption>G.NA最近宣布將重新錄製過去大熱歌曲。（Instagram@missginachoi87）</figcaption></figure><p>沉寂八年拚復出　宣布重錄經典神曲</p><figure><img alt=\"G.NA（IG@baidugnabar）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260429/1126196187435634688183065.jpeg/r-oYjtraYvyEeibWr36sGY4qSI1Kj5_uIejDIiHowyI\"/><figcaption>G.NA（IG@baidugnabar）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"G.NA（IG@baidugnabar）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260429/1126196189646163968940712.jpeg/Ec26Q9yioC1ZmvHWnjkI5d5WmE_2sVXMoM7MHKDOzBw\"/><figcaption>G.NA（IG@baidugnabar）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"G.NA（IG@baidugnabar）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260429/1126196192729108480320794.jpeg/-5OD0vmMOktGWpZDPWSSoR3k6te7zIILOvz4bDr8-Gw\"/><figcaption>G.NA（IG@baidugnabar）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"G.NA（IG@baidugnabar）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260429/1126196194662813696423876.jpeg/kjY0TmULz0wY3wYpL922sLt02KemQb3P5vRtpOb0baQ\"/><figcaption>G.NA（IG@baidugnabar）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"G.NA（IG@baidugnabar）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260429/1126196197112418304382175.jpeg/PMMkm7kGqw7f18FExaaUp8yUXGhbmNxoztjHqc7Yx6k\"/><figcaption>G.NA（IG@baidugnabar）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"G.NA（IG@baidugnabar）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260429/1126196186873597952135274.jpeg/HK9Dlftf4DAwvkVOCCRr_S9b_KUGaNkRIQTBfCEEwXw\"/><figcaption>G.NA（IG@baidugnabar）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"G.NA（IG@baidugnabar）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260429/11261961889834639364172